   "why": "The Kotoshironushi episode (from 'I cannot speak… Cape Miho… capsized his boat, Heavenly Reverse Hand, green brushwood fence') appears in both Englishes. That is correct, because the book prints it twice: in classical Chinese on p518 (僕者不得白…天逆手矣於青柴垣打成而隱也) and in Japanese reading on p517. The p518 English leaves out its own Japanese-reading passage (是を以て此の二ばしらの神…言依) and the line about the land being given to the heavenly child (汝之宇志波祁流葦原中國者…言依賜). It also adds two notes that are not in the source."
